<title>CHINA: EMPEROR INT'L YEAR NET RISES 38.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>EMPEROR INT'L YEAR NET RISES 38.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   30.8	 vs 22.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.8	  vs 1.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  33.34 loss vs 7.38 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    112.17     vs 80.88</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,465.06   vs 1,820.56</p>
<p>    Company name		 Emperor International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 18-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Emperor International is a property investment company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$19.80 million on write down of carring value of a holiday resort and loss of HK$13.53 million on provision for advances and accrued interest receivable due from minority shareholders of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.6 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.8 cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
